# This file is processed, line by line, on client startup.
# Each (non-empty, non-coment) line is interpreted as a class name,
# and the corresponding class is loaded by calling Class.forName.
# The purpose is that each loaded class will create a Logger by calling
# ApplicationLog.getLogger, so that the log-level configuration UI knows
# which loggers exists.
